{
 "_설명": "버들잎 일본판 PHASE 1 본녹음 78줄 (확정 캐스트, Typecast ssfm-v30 jpn). 음성 입력만 가나 변형, 자막은 한자 유지. 줄 번호 = 시간 순서(ASS 줄 순서와 일치해야 함). TTS 구독 크레딧만 사용.",
 "tc_model": "ssfm-v30",
 "language": "jpn",
 "tests": [
  {
   "id": "line001",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "八月、鎌倉。その日、気温はさんじゅうななどを超えていた。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line002",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "水を……一口だけ、もらえんか……",
   "emotion_preset": "whisper",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line003",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ちょっと、おじいさん。ここ休憩所じゃないんで。買わないなら出てってもらえます?そんな格好で座り込まれたら、お客さんが逃げるんだよ",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 1.1
  },
  {
   "id": "line004",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_633d5244093ca33db95ddfce",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おじいさん、ゆっくり飲んでください。一気に飲むと、むせて吐いちゃいますから",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line005",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "店長代理の坂本は、知らなかった。自分が追い出したこの老人が、この店の本部、そうしさんさんちょうえんのおがたホールディングスの創業会長、おがたりゅうぞうだということを。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line006",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "そして三日後。この一枚の柳の葉が、二人の運命を正反対に分けることになる。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line007",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……しずこ",
   "emotion_preset": "whisper",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.8
  },
  {
   "id": "line008",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "老人が呼んだその名前の意味を、この時はまだ、誰も知らなかった。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line009",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おきゆな、にじゅういっさい。昼はコンビニ、夜は居酒屋の洗い場。大学は、一年前から休学している。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line010",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "入院中の祖母の治療費、じゅうはちまんえん。払えなければ、来月には退院を迫られる。",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line011",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ゆな、また痩せたんじゃないかい。ばあちゃんのことは、ええからね",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line012",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_633d5244093ca33db95ddfce",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "大丈夫。……昨日ね、柳の葉っぱ、浮かべてあげたんだよ。おばあちゃんに教わったやつ",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line013",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "そうかい。あれはね、ばあちゃんの故郷の話なんよ",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line014",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "ばあちゃんの生まれた韓国のナジュってところにね、泉があってね。喉の渇いた若い武将に、娘さんが水をあげたの。急いで飲んでむせないように、柳の葉を一枚浮かべて",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line015",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "その武将が、のちにこうらいっていう国を建てた王様になったんだって。喉の渇いた人に、水を差し出す。それが、人の道だよ",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line016",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "祖母はじゅうくのとき、ナジュから海を渡ってきた。異国の地で守り続けたのは、この小さな教えだった。",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line017",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "はい、エリア長! 今月もロス率、ゼロでいけます。正式店長の件、ぜひよろしくお願いします!",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.1
  },
  {
   "id": "line018",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おきさん。昨日のこれ。店の水と紙コップ、勝手に使ったよね。立派な備品の私的流用だよ",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line019",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_633d5244093ca33db95ddfce",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "給水器のお水です。紙コップは、私が自分で買って置いてるもので……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line020",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "言い訳はいい。今週末、本部の監査が来るんだよ。俺の正式店長の審査がかかってんの。あんなのが店先に座り込んでたなんて報告されたら、どうしてくれるわけ?",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.1
  },
  {
   "id": "line021",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "始末書、書いて。今月のバイト代からさんまんえん引くから",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line022",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おばあさんの入院費、払えないんだって? ここクビになって、すぐ次のバイト見つかると思う? ……黙ってハンコ、押しなよ",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line023",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_633d5244093ca33db95ddfce",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……書きます",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.2,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line024",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "水一杯の代償は、さんまんえんだった。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line025",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "坂本はその始末書を、本部へのざいこロスのげんいんほうこくに添付した。帳簿の穴を、アルバイトのせいにするために。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line026",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "だが、その夜。思いもよらないことが起きたのです……",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line027",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "それでもゆなは、帰り道、柳の下にペットボトルを一本置いた。",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line028",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6322940059d649937b97f326",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "会長、ですから申し上げたのです。お一人で、しかもお電話も持たずに……",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line029",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "しじゅうくにちを終えた男の、わがままだ",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line030",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "妻のしじゅうくにちを終えたその日、おがたは運転手を駅に残し、一人で妻の故郷を訪ねた。携帯の電池が切れ、炎天下で倒れたのは、その帰り道だった。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line031",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……佐藤。あの店のことを調べてくれ。あの子のことも",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line032",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "こういうの置くなって。浮浪者が寄ってくるだろ",
   "emotion_preset": "angry",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 1.05
  },
  {
   "id": "line033",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "次の日も、その次の日も。柳の下には、新しい水が置かれていた。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line034",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "あの井戸に、もう一度行きたいねえ……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line035",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "あの柳の葉の話を教えた子が、昔、もう一人おったねえ……",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line036",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_633d5244093ca33db95ddfce",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "え、誰?",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line037",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……昔の話よ",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.5,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line038",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6322940059d649937b97f326",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "調べがつきました。坂本店長代理は、この半年で売上金をおよそにひゃくまんえん……。その穴を、アルバイトの始末書で埋めていました",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line039",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6322940059d649937b97f326",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おきゆなさんの分も、昨日、本部に上がっています",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line040",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……水一杯で、あの子にぬすびとの汚名を着せたのか",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.2,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line041",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "監査部を全員集めろ。土曜日、鎌倉店には……私が行く",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line042",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おきさん、今日は本部の方が帰るまで倉庫から出ないで。顔見せたら……わかってるよね",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line043",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "坂本は信じていた。今日こそ、自分の人生が変わる日だと。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line044",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おがたホールディングス鎌倉店、店長代理の坂本でございます!本日は会長自らお越しいただき、誠に光栄で——",
   "emotion_preset": "toneup",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.2,
   "tempo": 1.1
  },
  {
   "id": "line045",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……あの日も、ずいぶん丁寧な接客だったな",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line046",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "え……あ、いや……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line047",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "あの日、柳の葉を浮かべて水をくれた子は……どこにいる",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line048",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "そ、それは……ただのアルバイトで……",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line049",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "倉庫の扉を、開けなさい",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.2,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line050",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "扉の向こうにいたのは、まだ何も知らない、一人の娘だった。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line051",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_633d5244093ca33db95ddfce",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おじいさん……? よかった……お体、大丈夫でしたか? あの日、すごく顔色が悪かったから",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line052",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "彼女は、会長かとは聞かなかった。体は大丈夫かと、聞いた。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line053",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おきさん。あの柳の葉は……誰に教わったのかね",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line054",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_633d5244093ca33db95ddfce",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "祖母です。喉が渇いている人に、急に冷たいお水をあげると、むせて吐いてしまうから。葉っぱをよけながら、ゆっくり飲めるようにって",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line055",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "六十年前、この町の井戸のそばで、腹をすかせて倒れた私に、同じように水をくれた娘がいた。……私の妻だ。この春、先に逝った",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.8,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line056",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "あの日、君に水をもらって……もう一度、あいつに会えた気がしたんだ",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.2,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line057",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_633d5244093ca33db95ddfce",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……祖母に、必ず伝えます",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line058",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "佐藤。見せてやれ",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line059",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb42eef5b688d8cadd086",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "坂本健二さん。売上金の着服。そして、お祖母様の入院費という弱みにつけ込んだ、始末書の強要とさんまんえんの減給。給料からの一方的な天引きは、労働基準法違反です",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line060",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_63f7167e54b37fb5326409d1",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "会長、違うんです! あの時の方が会長だと知っていたら、僕は——",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.3,
   "tempo": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "line061",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "それだ。知っていれば頭を下げ、知らなければ外へ放り出す。人を服で量る者に、うちの看板は預けられん",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.2,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line062",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb42eef5b688d8cadd086",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "本日付で懲戒解雇とします。業務上横領と強要については、刑事告訴と損害賠償請求の手続きに入ります",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line063",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_673eb42eef5b688d8cadd086",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おきさん。差し引かれたさんまんえんは、本日中にお返しします。始末書も、取り消しです",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line064",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "彼が磨き上げた床には、最後まで、自分の顔しか映っていなかった。",
   "emotion_preset": "tonedown",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line065",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "お孫さんに、命を救われました。治療費は、おがた財団でお引き受けします。これはお礼ではありません。返しそびれていた、借りです",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line066",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "水一杯で……そんな",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.5,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line067",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……しずちゃん? この子……しずちゃんじゃないかい",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line068",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……妻を、ご存じなのですか",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line069",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_6a867e7a0e6ddfd2f2dd17b6",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "隣に住んでた子だよ。柳の葉の話……あの子に教えたのは、私なんよ",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line070",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……では私は、六十年のあいだに二度も……あなたに救われたのですね",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.3,
   "tempo": 0.85
  },
  {
   "id": "line071",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_640997d2c535f40558c0722c",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "おきさん。財団にやなぎのはしょうがくきんを作る。君に、その最初の一人になってほしい。……大学に、戻りなさい",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.5,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line072",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_633d5244093ca33db95ddfce",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "……はい",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.2,
   "tempo": 0.95
  },
  {
   "id": "line073",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "千年前、柳の葉は一人の娘に王を引き合わせたという。だが本当の奇跡は、その葉が六十年をかけて、救われた人のもとへ帰ってきたことだった。",
   "emotion_preset": "sad",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.9,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line074",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_65681f21097fc4326ceb5e21",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "誰かが渇いて見えたら、名前も服も問わず、水を一杯。急がず、ゆっくりと。",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "line075",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_629fe972013e90b4db213fd8",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "最後までご覧いただき、ありがとうございました",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line076",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_629fe972013e90b4db213fd8",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "心に残る物語でしたら、高評価とチャンネル登録で応援していただけると嬉しいです",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.6,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line077",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_629fe972013e90b4db213fd8",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "次回も、時代を超えて人の心を温める、優しさと絆の物語をお届けします",
   "emotion_preset": "normal",
   "emotion_intensity": 1.0,
   "tempo": 1.0
  },
  {
   "id": "line078",
   "model": "typecast-direct",
   "voice": "tc_629fe972013e90b4db213fd8",
   "language": "jpn",
   "text": "それでは、また次のお話で",
   "emotion_preset": "happy",
   "emotion_intensity": 0.7,
   "tempo": 1.0
  }
 ]
}